# Allow-list: this repository is public, so only the files below may ever be tracked.
# Add a file here deliberately, then add it to ALLOWED in scripts/privacy-check.cjs too.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!index.html
!privacy.html
!scripts/
!scripts/privacy-check.cjs
!scripts/git-hooks/
!scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit
!scripts/git-hooks/pre-push
